<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randfontein details hedging portfolio.</title>
<headline>Randfontein details hedging portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>JCI Ltd said on Tuesday that Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co Witwatersrand Ltd's hedging portfolio as at December 31, 1996 consisted of the following:</p>
<p>    1997			  Forward sales	    Put options</p>
<p>kilograms			 3,243			482</p>
<p>ounces			    104,255		    15,500</p>
<p>weighted average</p>
<p> forward price (rand/kg)    54,937		     57,541</p>
<p>1998</p>
<p>kilograms			 3,007			467</p>
<p>ounces			    96,685		     15,000</p>
<p>weighted average</p>
<p> forward price (rand/kg)    60,979		     61,083</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
